 "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771272_1493109529395098_419195257702898078_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3bkDa63uGZEQ7kNvwHEYB4V&_nc_oc=AdqlLFEFQyUj1FfPY6DXheE9wFTjKCGnmRNC5DONoOxcRCw37zt-fdi6MUTbrTBizJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXuSW9O2ff45PkfBVNEgIZA-E5wLxyHegTbRdvA5EI-nQ&oe=6B0EF915"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "4397001020444858", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771264_4397001027111524_3029804432238249233_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8UoJte5op4EQ7kNvwGz-F9h&_nc_oc=Adp3c_p8rB1hMGnSDy2Yt1fqTTkBFC9LEWNeiSA8CuQA7OjKUeCsCOZf6f6v6I8UiFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUpbLYaLCF32deApP0synpZzJbK6ZYkVcBczaf0aBcSoA&oe=6B0EFC67"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_3.png", "id": "2168799924009445", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771238_2168799930676111_6696759473013163292_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U6RASoccYfUQ7kNvwFyp1Br&_nc_oc=AdpR2Zm6HqNObObXyohDazF40Gse8XatgczP8TMmtXO1HbNUMikVfA1sIqADUPTcdBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUJE0BN9W2equPOuiBSPCvJ8BBn96RQ5Pzb1qwTNMAaLw&oe=6B0F0196"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2.png", "id": "1646644036997952", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771253_1646644043664618_1100551394213034408_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMZlJmC8u-gQ7kNvwFnecmW&_nc_oc=AdrtEzqtpy6dU4g1RJU6rHZbjsmE5_eiGdudHFAnG5dNu4-JWbsstuXJf68aNQBSxEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWbdfZrbCad1R4x81lSIYAv5-ECCZm2ogFF9eYlPoo19g&oe=6B0F19AA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_4.png", "id": "1518444226857348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771308_1518444230190681_5772005371062819448_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4WKLgw7WN08Q7kNvwHhP_mh&_nc_oc=AdrDSfkvej9vsILfaxadCfqoHp4qCTGlx5NmYdK3gHxBKK96lj5Ug3JDLnaWktGV4Hc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVlF6IEMRlekhX94E5JGrifCGE4qaDtXLrQFD9NaujPYA&oe=6B0F1C80"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aurora Cinema", "keywords": ["jellyfin", "iptv", "cinema", "movies", "streaming"], "long_description": "Aurora Cinema turns your headset into a private cinema for the films and series you already have: your own Jellyfin server and the IPTV subscription from your provider.\n\nBrowse in a comfortable panel, then step into the theater: the film plays on a big screen, and you sit in a seat of your own.\n\nPLACES TO WATCH\n\u2022 Grand Theater: red velvet and a starlit ceiling, from a VIP row\n\u2022 Orbital Deck: a lounge above a planet, under a sea of stars\n\u2022 Sentinel HQ: a penthouse high above a city at night\n\u2022 Arcane Library: floating candles and a crackling fire\n\u2022 Biolume Grove: a glowing jungle under two moons\n\u2022 Northern lights, a dark room, or your own room\n\nThe room reacts to the film: press play and the lights go down; pause and they come back up.\n\nYOUR LIBRARY AND IPTV\n\u2022 Continue Watching, favourites, genres and search\n\u2022 Progress syncs back to your server\n\u2022 Audio and subtitle choice\n\u2022 Profiles for shared households\n\u2022 Your own M3U, Xtream Codes or stream URL, with a TV guide\n\nAurora Cinema includes no channels or media of its own: you need your own Jellyfin server or IPTV provider.\n\nNo accounts, no ads, no tracking. Open source at github.com/Get-Coral/aurora. Not affiliated with the Jellyfin project.", "short_description": "Watch your own Jellyfin library and IPTV on a big screen in a private cinema, a starship lounge, a candlelit library or under the northern lights."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1839662293716097", "locale": "nl_NL", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aurora Cinema", "keywords": ["jellyfin", "iptv", "bioscoop", "films", "streaming"], "long_description": "Aurora Cinema maakt van je headset een priv\u00e9bioscoop voor de films en series die je al hebt: je eigen Jellyfin-server en het IPTV-abonnement van je provider.\n\nBlader in een comfortabel paneel en stap dan de bioscoop in: de film speelt op een groot scherm, en je zit in een eigen zetel.\n\nPLEKKEN OM TE KIJKEN\n\u2022 Grand Theater: rood fluweel en een sterrenplafond, vanaf een VIP-rij\n\u2022 Orbitaal dek: een lounge boven een planeet, onder een zee van sterren\n\u2022 Sentinel HQ: een penthouse hoog boven een nachtelijke stad\n\u2022 Magische bibliotheek: zwevende kaarsen en een knetterend haardvuur\n\u2022 Lichtend woud: een gloeiende jungle onder twee manen\n\u2022 Poollicht, een donkere zaal, of je eigen kamer\n\nDe zaal reageert op de film: druk op play en de lichten dimmen, pauzeer en ze gaan weer aan.\n\nJE BIBLIOTHEEK EN IPTV\n\u2022 Verder kijken, favorieten, genres en zoeken\n\u2022 Voortgang wordt gesynchroniseerd met je server\n\u2022 Keuze van audio en ondertitels\n\u2022 Profielen voor gedeelde huishoudens\n\u2022 Je eigen M3U, Xtream Codes of stream-URL, met tv-gids\n\nAurora Cinema bevat zelf geen zenders of media: je hebt je eigen Jellyfin-server of IPTV-provider nodig.\n\nGeen accounts, geen advertenties, geen tracking. Open source op github.com/Get-Coral/aurora. Niet verbonden aan het Jellyfin-project.", "short_description": "Bekijk je eigen Jellyfin-bibliotheek en IPTV op een groot scherm in een priv\u00e9bioscoop, een ruimteschiplounge, een bibliotheek bij kaarslicht of onder het poollicht."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://getcoral.dev/apps/aurora/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ElianCodes BV", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Get-Coral/aurora/issues", "website_url": "https://github.com/Get-Coral/aurora", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "nl"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1402783719591720"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1156706903471752"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1156706903471752"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795604580, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1156706903471752"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1411072108762881", "version": "1.17.0"}, "id": "1659924945632210", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1402783709591721", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1411072108762881"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1659924945632210"}]}, "change_log": "IPTV films and series now sit next to your Jellyfin library under Films and Series. On Android TV, phones and tablets, they play in a new native player with Dolby and Atmos sound, even on devices without a Dolby decoder, and their cover shows while the stream loads. TV mode is lighter, fits more on screen and is easier to drive with the remote. Plus fixes for sound that ran out of sync.", "created_date": 1795696132, "id": "1411072108762881", "version": "1.17.0", "version_code": 1170000, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1402783709591721", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1411072108762881"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1659924945632210"}]}, "change_log": "Films and series from Jellyfin and IPTV together under Films and Series; Live TV is channels and the guide only. Lighter, denser layout.", "created_date": 1795440046, "id": "1405111729358919", "version": "1.16.0", "version_code": 1160001, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1402783709591721", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1411072108762881"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795364613, "id": "1402924976244261", "version": "1.15.0", "version_code": 1150003, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Applic